    <div class="rv" style="margin-bottom:56px">
      <h2 class="h2"><em class="s">One Platform</em> for All Connectivity Management</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards rv">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="viz mk" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="code" set:html={CODE} />
          <div class="chips"><span class="acc">Spenza network</span><span>Bring your own</span><span>Operator A</span><span>Operator B</span><span>+176</span></div>
        </div>
        <h3>One API For All</h3>
        <p>Access 180+ carriers through one REST API and one dashboard with no integration hell, use our network or bring your own.</p>
